FOOTNOTE 1: Per City Resolution 6191, a budget line item was created in the Community Recreation and Events
Administration Division budget in Fiscal Year 2023 named Lottery Proceeds Capital Expenditures in the amount of
$323,579. Per this resolution, lottery funds shall be earmarked for CRE capital expenditures. Lottery proceeds
have been estimated to be $400,000 in Fiscal Year 2024. A portion of these funds ($76,421) have been
appropriated for one year to hire an Arborist in the Community Recreation & Events Forestry Division.
